 * consumes additional characters from the surrounding line until the
 * parentheses are balanced.
 *
 * Extension stops when:
 *   - whitespace is encountered in the line, or
 *   - appending a closing parenthesis would over-balance the URL (result in
 *     more closing parentheses than opening ones).
